{"parse": {"title": "河港与海之间-08", "pageid": 88866, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-07\" title=\"河港与海之间-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">河港与海之间-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">河港与海之间</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.89.AF.E5.A4.9C.E5.A4.9A.E5.AE.81.E9.9D.99\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"良夜多宁静\">良夜多宁静</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 良夜多宁静</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Such a Serene Evening</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>演奏会临近结束，台上的少女令最后的音符也顺利跃入空气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在众人离场前，她展开了手中那张被收起的点歌单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>今天的最后一首曲子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>给这位与我来自同一个国家的旅客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>请各位稍作等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将“啪唧匣子”稳当地靠在了一侧的舱壁上，然后快步走向舞台边缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等在那儿的水手为她递上一把小提琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>……小提琴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>难道她来自克雷莫纳？这是那儿某个作坊的杰作？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>您就用自己的耳朵试着猜猜，如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>说不定以您的见识，还能听出这是哪位大师做的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下传来窸窸窣窣的议论声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每个人都将目光投向站在舞台中央的年轻音乐家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最适合这把琴的乐曲是怎样的？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_yanzou1\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_yanzou1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它应该在她出生的地方被广为传唱，也时常被街头的艺人流畅地演奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它是一只顺流而下的小船儿，是一段安稳平静的过往。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“故乡”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提及这个词汇，她最先想起的就是这首曲调。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是今晚的告别曲目，船员们开始组织客人按序离场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>掌声与赞叹都压得很低，不愿打乱一个音节，遮盖流淌的旋律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>啊……是这支曲子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>第一首被翻译成意大利语的那不勒斯歌曲，我小时候常听见它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>那时候并不觉得它有这么动听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>离开故乡太久，偶尔再听见一次，忽然觉得之前从没有听过这样好的演奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>所以您对这场演奏会很满意——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>并且打算向您的亲朋好友介绍自由海风号！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>当然！我会朝每个认识的人夸奖这艘游轮，还有它优秀的乐手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>我要过一会再回房间，这样的音乐不能错过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">客人：</div><div>直到它真正地、彻底地结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>我也是时候回去练习了，明天是整个乐队的合奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>等明早芭卡洛儿起床，我们还能再排练一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两位船员一前一后跨出了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>甲板上不剩多少人，只有零星的几位旅客吹着海风。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>你不是说这周就要从乐队离开，回家乡去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>还没和船长他们说过这事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>船长和我透露了一个秘密，我打算推迟休息计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>他找到了愿意接手这艘游轮的人——还定下了新的航行目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>那还真不错，反正我总是跟着船走，去哪都行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>不知道新的目的地有没有酒馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>也许没有，因为那是一座小岛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>不过听说岛上的居民有特别的习俗，会随身佩戴贝壳，说不定能有贝壳杯子盛的酒喝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-522001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>但也说不准……咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她捕捉到隔着门传来的一点声响，比划手势让同伴噤声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风儿差点就把微弱的歌声吹散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>In' fra le tende bandir la cena,<br />&lt;帐篷里飘香 月儿多安详&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>In una sera così serena.<br />&lt;安宁与静谧 伴随这月光&gt;</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>In una sera così serena.<br />&lt;安宁与静谧 伴随这月光&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Chi non dimanda,chi non desia.<br />&lt;谁不渴求呢 谁不期盼呢&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Santa lucia! Santa lucia!<br />&lt;桑塔露琪亚 桑塔露琪亚&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女主人听完了整首歌，让录音再次回到开头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>克雷莫纳难得如此寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船儿航向了哪片水域，送往家中的信又何时抵达？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只能祝福孩子一切平安。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_yanzou1\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_yanzou1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_yanzou1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_yanzou2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_yanzou2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_yanzou2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Cg-2_4_at_yanzou2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"700\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Sul mare luccica, l'astro d'argento.<br />&lt;月落海面上 银星多明亮&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Placida è l'onda, prospero è il vento.<br />&lt;浪花儿徜徉 轻拂我脸庞&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Venite all'agile, barchetta mia.<br />&lt;请随风儿来 同乘小船上&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Santa Lucia, Santa Lucia.<br />&lt;桑塔露琪亚 桑塔露琪亚&gt;</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "河港与海之间-08"}}